<title>QATAR: Qatar Navigation lifts 1996 net, dividend flat.</title>
<headline>Qatar Navigation lifts 1996 net, dividend flat.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (million Qatar riyals unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 77.68	   70.46</p>
<p>    Proposed cash dividend	 45.00	   45.00</p>
<p>    Shareholders funds	    742.65	  711.62</p>
<p>    Total assets		    771.31	  742.57</p>
<p>Name:Qatar National Navigation and Transport Company Ltd</p>
<p>Note: Qatar Navigation is 20 percent owned by Qatar's government and 80 percent by Qatari citizens and is traded on Qatar's unofficial stock market. It has declared 45 percent dividend on the paidup capital on register on December 31, 1996.</p>
</text>
